    {
      "text": "**`Question.  i have a table transaction and customer, with cust_id`**\n\nsample data\n\n```+----------+----------+----------+---------------+----------+----+-----+---+-------------+------+-----------+\n|cust_id   |start_date|end_date  |txn_id         |date      |year|month|day|expense_type |amt   |city       |\n+----------+----------+----------+---------------+----------+----+-----+---+-------------+------+-----------+\n|C0YDPQWPBJ|2010-07-01|2018-12-01|TZ5SMKZY9S03OQJ|2018-10-07|2018|10   |7  |Entertainment|10.42 |boston     |\n|C0YDPQWPBJ|2010-07-01|2018-12-01|TYIAPPNU066CJ5R|2016-03-27|2016|3    |27 |Motor/Travel |44.34 |portland   |\n```\n---\n1. find the city wise  total expense  on  expense_type\n2. find year and city wise total expenses on diffrent expense type\n3. find year,month and city wise total expense on diffrent expense type\n4. which month of year has max expense\n5. which month of year has max expense on Entertainment",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
