        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "ba27532ca74e46589f02b"
    },
    {
      "text": "**`Question. How many Job and Task would get created for below along with Steps involved in Catalyst optimizer -> CBO ->Adaptive query engine`**\n\n---\njobs:\n\n1. df.filter(f.col(\"city\") === \"Boston\").filter(f.col(\"year\") === \"2018\" and f.col(\"month\").isin(\"11\",\"12\"))\n2. df.groupBy(\"city\").agg(sum(f.col(\"amt\")))\n3. df.repartion(8,col(\"city\"))\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
